OL,5,G1700 In Tune
OL,6,     FPetroc introduces live music from
OL,7,     Fpianist Mariam Batsashvili. Petroc
OL,8,     Falso chats to Christopher White
OL,9,     Fabout the legacy of Dame Felicity
OL,10,     FLott.
OL,11,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,12,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Fsoundscape of classical music.
OL,14,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     FViolinist Mari Samuelsen joins the
OL,16,     FScottish Chamber Orchestra and
OL,17,     Fconductor David Brophy for works
OL,18,     Fby Philip Glass, John Adams and
OL,19,     FMax Richter.
